{"slug":"sherrod-brown","qid":"Q381880","name":"Sherrod Brown","desc":"American politician and educator (born 1952)","article":"Sherrod Brown","born":"1952-11-09","died":null,"birthplace":"Mansfield","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Senator","w":"Ohio","f":2007,"u":2025},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"OH-13","f":1993,"u":2007},{"t":"Secretary of State of Ohio","w":"","f":1983,"u":1991},{"t":"Ohio House of Representatives","w":"","f":1975,"u":1983}],"summary":"Sherrod Campbell Brown ( SHERR-əd; born November 9, 1952) is an American politician who is a United States senator-elect from Ohio, a position he previously served in from 2007 to 2025. Prior to his tenure in the U.S. Senate, he served in the Ohio House of Representatives from 1975 to 1983, was Ohio secretary of state from 1983 to 1991, and was the U.S. representative for Ohio's 13th congressional district from 1993 to 2007. He is a member of the Democratic Party.","photo":{"f":"sherrod-brown.jpg","by":"U.S. Senate Photographic Services; Rebecca Hammel","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sherrod_Brown_117th_Congress_(2).jpg"},"history":[{"y":2026,"o":"S","k":"OH-SEN","p":"D","n":"Sherrod Brown","race":"OH-SEN"},{"y":2024,"o":"S","k":"OH","p":"D","v":2650949,"s":46.47,"w":false,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":2018,"o":"S","k":"OH","p":"D","v":2355923,"s":53.41,"w":true,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":2012,"o":"S","k":"OH","p":"D","v":2762690,"s":50.7,"w":true,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":2006,"o":"S","k":"OH","p":"D","v":2257369,"s":56.16,"w":true,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":201004,"s":67.43,"w":true,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":123025,"s":68.97,"w":true,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":170058,"s":64.59,"w":true,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v":116309,"s":61.55,"w":true,"n":"Sherrod Brown"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"OH-13","p":"D","v"